      "message": "Also check that incoming extra is not equal to TPM2_ECC_EK_NAME_CR50, to make sure a random other path does not access the EK?\nI\u0027m not sure where the access control around EK usage is.",
      "revId": "d51b8ebf832adc65bfc805e12efc6bc00d4ba7db",
